  "headline": "Bareskrim Investigates Former Police Chief In Treason Probe",
  "seoTitle": "Bareskrim Investigates Listyo Sigit Prabowo for Treason",
  "metaDescription": "Bareskrim Polri has questioned former police chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and three other generals regarding allegations of treason against President Prabowo.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri has questioned former national police chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and three other generals in a treason investigation.",
    "The inquiry is centered on allegations of illicit surveillance conducted by the former police leadership against President Prabowo Subianto.",
    "Authorities have interrogated 59 witnesses, though officials state that no formal suspects have been named in the treason case thus far."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police criminal investigation unit, Bareskrim Polri, is currently conducting a high-profile inquiry into alleged treason targeting President Prabowo Subianto. Central to the investigation are claims of unauthorized surveillance previously carried out by former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and several high-ranking officers. Reports indicate that these surveillance operations allegedly targeted prominent public figures, including business individuals and media personalities. In addition to the treason allegations, investigators are examining the scope and origins of the wiretapping scandal, which reportedly prompted the government to enhance internal cyber security measures. While investigative proceedings continue and case files have been forwarded to the Public Prosecutor's Office, officials have maintained that the individuals under scrutiny have not yet been officially declared suspects, emphasizing the ongoing nature of the legal process regarding the 59 witnesses interviewed.",
